[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 722.23, "timestamp": "00:12:02", "text": "正しいデザインのトークン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 724.47, "timestamp": "00:12:04", "text": "だから、もし私が何か変更する必要があるなら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 726.71, "timestamp": "00:12:06", "text": "ほんの少しの変化なら、私はできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 729.269, "timestamp": "00:12:09", "text": "それらのいずれかに変更するとすべてが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 732.55, "timestamp": "00:12:12", "text": "そうでなければ変更されます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 737.509, "timestamp": "00:12:17", "text": "すべてのページにわたって。うん。それで、それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 739.509, "timestamp": "00:12:19", "text": "当社は以下のアイテムを収集する場合があります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 743.59, "timestamp": "00:12:23", "text": "ここ。メインテキストは既に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 745.35, "timestamp": "00:12:25", "text": "持っている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 747.829, "timestamp": "00:12:27", "text": "わかった。では、この男はどうだろうか？それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 750.87, "timestamp": "00:12:30", "text": "既に持っている。あなたは既にそれを持っている。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 756.71, "timestamp": "00:12:36", "text": "あなたについて？あなたはそれを持っていません。ペースト。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 759.19, "timestamp": "00:12:39", "text": "クッキーとトラッキング。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 761.59, "timestamp": "00:12:41", "text": "はい。あなたもそれを持っていません。なし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 764.15, "timestamp": "00:12:44", "text": "そこには。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 766.018, "timestamp": "00:12:46", "author": "@cls_c69", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1xH00l4co0AqxQmOLp2YF4nFFs-UBbNlpq_DoiGUhLHz03uM5S1Zs8RwEOVwnKpZAX9wM3P_Zg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what is your favorite perfume?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 766.15, "timestamp": "00:12:46", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 770.71, "timestamp": "00:12:50", "text": "これらすべて。お気に入りの香水は何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 773.03, "timestamp": "00:12:53", "text": "何？ああ、なんてことだ、それはランダムな奇妙な"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 777.269, "timestamp": "00:12:57", "text": "今まで一度も